hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18648","Waki narrated to us, Isa ibn Dinar narrated to us from his father from Amr ibn al-Harith ibn al-Mustaliq, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: Whoever loves to recite the Quran fresh as it was revealed, let him recite it upon the reading of Ibn Umm Abd."
"18649","Abd al-Rahman narrated to us from Sufyan - and Ishaq, meaning al-Azraq, said: Sufyan narrated to us - from Abu Ishaq, he said: I heard Amr ibn al-Harith - Ishaq said: Ibn al-Mustaliq - say: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, left nothing except his weapon, a white mule, and land which he made charity."
